{"id":"besatzung","lemma":"Besatzung","pos":"noun","rank":4035,"glosses":["crew (group of people operating a ship, plane, or large facility)","occupation (of a country)","occupational troops, occupational forces"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c4/De-Besatzung.ogg/De-Besatzung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Besatzung","plural":"Besatzungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Die Besatzung hat das Schiff aufgegeben.","en":"The crew abandoned the ship.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"abandoned"}]},{"text":"Die gesamte Besatzung wurde gerettet.","en":"All the crew were saved.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"total","l":"gesamt"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"to save, to rescue","l":"retten"}]},{"text":"Die gesamte Besatzung ist an Bord.","en":"The whole crew is on board.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"total","l":"gesamt"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"aboard, on board"]]},{"text":"Ich werde Sie dem Rest der Besatzung vorstellen.","en":"I'll introduce you to the rest of the crew.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"rest"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to introduce"}]},{"text":"Moderne Schiffe brauchen nur eine kleine Besatzung.","en":"Modern ships only need a small crew.","words":[{"g":"modern","l":"modern"},{"g":"ship","l":"Schiff"},{"g":"to need"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"small, little, wee","l":"klein"},null]}]}